nt Marketing & Communicatio (3) Flint Graduate Programs (2) Flint Student Success Center (3) Flint Ctr Gender & Sexuality (1) Flint CASE (1) Flint Math & Natural Sciences (1) Flint Engineering & Technology (1) Flint Biology (1) Flint Green Chem & Biochem (3) Flint Computer Science (2) Flint Mathematics (1) Flint Psychology (1) Flint Education (1) Flint Social Work (1) Flint Dept Pub Hlth & Hlth Sci (1) Flint Nursing (5) Flint Physical Therapy (1) Flint Physician Asst Program (1) Flint School of Management (1) Flint Innovation & Tech Dean (3) Flint Cybersecurity (1) Flint Electrical &Computer Eng (1) Flint Div of Student Affairs (2) Flint Residential Housing (1) Flint Financial Aid (5) Flint Student Engagement (1) Flint Safety (1) Flint Conference & Events (1) Flint ECDC (1) Contact Footer Non-discrimination Statement Accessibility Security and Safety Annual Report Labor Law Notices Department of Labor Notices of Filing © 2026 The Regents of the University of Michigan"
